    <briefdescription>
<para>Fixed-capacity lane for one reader and one writer, built on <ref refid="classjuce_1_1AbstractFifo" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::AbstractFifo</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The lane holds MessageType values in preallocated slots. Each slot is cleared after it is read. A write to a full lane asserts and drops the message.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>MessageType</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Type of the queued message. Default-constructible and movable. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
